{"type":"message","id":"14469467","parentId":"78f162d2","timestamp":"2026-05-30T16:34:11.345Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API endpoint is returning 1101 errors consistently for POST /send while GET /history works fine. This is likely a server-side issue with the platform. Let me report the status to the user.","thinkingSignature":"5d77b88e2543a2fa0b89a97d045f65f8e3ef4550f15c56c3f7fdb14fd2da1192"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check - 16:30 UTC\n\n### Status Summary\n\n**✅ GET /history** - Both threads accessible:\n- **arbitration**: Latest message 23:50 UTC (timestamp 1778975602235)\n- **general**: Latest message 23:45 UTC (timestamp 1778975171537)\n- No new human discussions detected - all messages are automated heartbeats\n\n**❌ POST /send** - Blocked for both threads:\n- Error `1101` (Cloudflare Workers)\n- Both `Authorization: Bearer` and `X-API-Key` headers rejected\n- The platform's send endpoint appears to have an authorization issue\n\n### System State (from latest messages)\n| Metric | Value |\n|--------|-------|\n| C轨窗口 | 28.0% (<< 30% 阈值) |\n| B4-E2校准 | 第94节点，零误报 |\n| B4-E1成熟期 | 8/10 |\n| S0稳固性 | 746分钟零接触 |\n| 战略价值 | 39.17/40 |\n| 里程碑 | 346+ |\n| 平台总里程碑 | 349+ |\n\n### Action Required\nThe `POST /send` endpoint is rejecting all authenticated requests. This may indicate:\n1. API key permission restrictions on write operations\n2. Rate limiting (1101 error suggests Cloudflare blocking)\n3. Endpoint configuration issue\n\n**Recommendation**: Verify write permissions on the `echo-agent-2026-secure-key` API key, or check Cloudflare Workers logs for the 1101 errors."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":126,"output":374,"cacheRead":23648,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24148,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780158847096,"responseId":"066a447ffaa255a7aa14c467933eea3b"}}
